# The #114 shape (pure EL): ∃r.⊤ ⊑ ∃s.S with X ⊑ ∃r.B and ∃s.S ⊑ Z gives X ⊑ Z.
# Mutant M8a (#114 revert) loses it in the saturator every surface shares:
# expected NOT caught by any cross-command law.
Declaration(Class(:X)) Declaration(Class(:B)) Declaration(Class(:S)) Declaration(Class(:Z))
Declaration(ObjectProperty(:r)) Declaration(ObjectProperty(:s))
SubClassOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:r owl:Thing) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:s :S))
SubClassOf(:X ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:r :B))
SubClassOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(:s :S) :Z)
)
